# 🗺️ Implementation Plan — PesisirConnect

> **Dokumen ini berisi analisis menyeluruh terhadap kondisi project saat ini dan rencana pengembangan fitur lanjutan, dikelompokkan berdasarkan prioritas.**

---

## � STATUS PRODUCTION READINESS (Updated: June 15, 2026)

### Overall: 85% READY ⚠️

**READY FOR PRODUCTION:**
- ✅ Core marketplace features (listing, checkout, payment, reviews)
- ✅ Admin dashboard & management
- ✅ Vendor portal (products, orders, earnings, payouts)
- ✅ Email system (code complete, just need SMTP config)
- ✅ Invoice PDF generation
- ✅ Authorization & policies
- ✅ Customer dashboard & wishlists

**BLOCKERS BEFORE LAUNCH (3-4 jam kerja):**
- 🔴 **Database**: SQLite → MySQL migration
- 🔴 **Email Config**: Configure SMTP (Mailtrap/SendGrid)
- 🟡 **Queue Worker**: Setup for async email (recommended)

**Action Required:** Selesaikan Sprint 2.5 items sebelum go-live.

