## �📊 Ringkasan Analisis Project

### Stack Teknologi
| Layer | Teknologi |
|---|---|
| Framework | Laravel 13 (PHP 8.3+) |
| Frontend | Blade + Tailwind CSS 3 + Alpine.js |
| Build Tool | Vite 8 |
| Admin Panel | Custom Laravel UI (Blade + Tailwind), Filament v5.6 available ✅ |
| Payment | Midtrans PHP SDK v2.6 ✅ (fully implemented - Snap popup, webhook, callback) |
| Database | SQLite (development) |
| Auth | Laravel Breeze |

