## 🚀 Rencana Pengembangan Fitur

---

### 🟢 SELESAI (Sprint 1 + 2)

Fitur kritikal berikut sudah berhasil diimplementasikan:
- ✅ **Checkout & Midtrans Integration**: Snap popup, webhook penanganan callback, auto cancel.
- ✅ **Customer Dashboard**: Menampilkan statistik dasar dan riwayat transaksi.
- ✅ **Sistem Review Customer**: Validasi per transaksi yang telah selesai.
- ✅ **Halaman Destinasi Dinamis**: Menggunakan data `Destination` yang diambil dari database.
- ✅ **Email Notification System**: Semua 5 mailables (OrderCreatedMail, PaymentReceivedMail, VendorApprovedMail, VendorNewOrderMail, PayoutProcessedMail) sudah fully implemented dengan queue support.
- ✅ **Invoice PDF Generation**: InvoiceService dengan barryvdh/laravel-dompdf, template profesional, support email attachment.
- ✅ **Admin Transaction Detail & Management**: TransactionController::show() + detail view, filters, search, export CSV, override status.
- ✅ **Authorization Policies**: ProductPolicy, TransactionPolicy, VendorReviewPolicy, fully integrated di semua controller.

