## ✅ PRODUCTION LAUNCH CHECKLIST

### Phase 1: Database Migration (2-3 jam) 🔴 **CRITICAL**

**Prerequisites:**
- [ ] MySQL server tersedia di production environment
- [ ] Database credentials siap

**Tasks:**
- [ ] Buat database baru di MySQL: `pesisir_connect_prod`
- [ ] Update `.env.production` atau `.env`:
  ```
  DB_CONNECTION=mysql
  DB_HOST=localhost
  DB_PORT=3306
  DB_DATABASE=pesisir_connect_prod
  DB_USERNAME=root
  DB_PASSWORD=***
  ```
- [ ] Run migrations: `php artisan migrate --force`
- [ ] Verify: Check 14 migrations dalam `migrations` table
- [ ] Seed data (categories, destinations): `php artisan db:seed --class=CategorySeeder`

**Validation:**
- [ ] Login ke admin panel - berhasil
- [ ] Buat vendor baru - berhasil
- [ ] Create product - berhasil
- [ ] Checkout flow - berhasil
- [ ] Admin transaction list - tampil data

---

### Phase 2: Email Configuration (30 menit) 🔴 **CRITICAL**

**Option A: Mailtrap (Testing/Development)**
- [ ] Daftar di https://mailtrap.io
- [ ] Dapatkan credentials (SMTP host, port, username, password)
- [ ] Update `.env`:
  ```
  MAIL_MAILER=smtp
  MAIL_HOST=smtp.mailtrap.io
  MAIL_PORT=2525
  MAIL_USERNAME=xxx
  MAIL_PASSWORD=xxx
  MAIL_FROM_ADDRESS=noreply@pesisir-connect.test
  MAIL_FROM_NAME="PesisirConnect"
  ```
- [ ] Test email: `php artisan tinker` → `Mail::to('test@test.com')->send(new OrderCreatedMail(...))`

**Option B: SendGrid (Production)**
- [ ] Daftar di https://sendgrid.com
- [ ] Generate API key
- [ ] Install package: `composer require sendgrid/sendgrid`
- [ ] Update `.env`:
  ```
  MAIL_MAILER=sendgrid
  SENDGRID_API_KEY=SG.xxxx
  MAIL_FROM_ADDRESS=noreply@pesisir-connect.com
  MAIL_FROM_NAME="PesisirConnect"
  ```

**Validation:**
- [ ] Jalankan checkout flow
- [ ] Verifikasi email masuk di test inbox
- [ ] Email berisi: order number, product, price, payment status

---

### Phase 3: Queue Worker Setup (1-2 jam) 🟡 **RECOMMENDED**

**Option A: Local Development (Supervisor)**
- [ ] Install Supervisor: `apt-get install supervisor`
- [ ] Create config file di `/etc/supervisor/conf.d/pesisir-queue.conf`:
  ```ini
  [program:pesisir-queue]
  process_name=%(program_name)s_%(process_num)02d
  command=php /var/www/pesisir-connect/artisan queue:work --sleep=3
  autostart=true
  autorestart=true
  numprocs=4
  redirect_stderr=true
  stdout_logfile=/var/log/pesisir-queue.log
  ```
- [ ] Start: `supervisorctl start pesisir-queue:*`

**Option B: PM2 (Node.js style)**
- [ ] Install PM2: `npm install -g pm2`
- [ ] Create ecosystem config:
  ```js
  module.exports = {
    apps: [{
      name: 'pesisir-queue',
      script: './artisan',
      args: 'queue:work',
      instances: 4,
      exec_mode: 'cluster'
    }]
  };
  ```
- [ ] Start: `pm2 start ecosystem.config.js`

**Validation:**
- [ ] Cek queue workers running: `php artisan queue:work --daemonize`
- [ ] Jalankan checkout flow
- [ ] Email terkirim dalam beberapa detik (async)
- [ ] Cek logs: `tail -f storage/logs/laravel.log`

---

### Phase 4: Security & Configuration

**Environment Security:**
- [ ] Change APP_DEBUG=false di `.env.production`
- [ ] Set APP_ENV=production
- [ ] Update CORS_ALLOWED_ORIGINS jika ada API
- [ ] Disable Telescope/Debugbar di production

**Database Security:**
- [ ] Create dedicated MySQL user (bukan root):
  ```sql
  CREATE USER 'pesisir'@'localhost' IDENTIFIED BY 'strong_password';
  GRANT ALL PRIVILEGES ON pesisir_connect_prod.* TO 'pesisir'@'localhost';
  FLUSH PRIVILEGES;
  ```

**File Permissions:**
- [ ] `chmod -R 755 storage/ bootstrap/cache/`
- [ ] `chmod -R 644 storage/logs/`

